The Core Problem

Today's enterprises have:

Sensitive documents
Internal databases
Source code
Customer tickets
Meeting transcripts
Regulatory documents

They cannot upload this data to public AI services.

As a result, employees spend hours searching across multiple systems.

PrivAgent solves this by creating an autonomous AI workforce that operates entirely on-premise using local LLMs.

